{{DISPLAYTITLE:Treasury and Gambling}}
__TOC__

Treasury is the central pool used for event payouts and tax sinks.

== Commands ==
* <code>/gamble coinflip amount:&lt;n&gt;</code>
* <code>/gamble dice amount:&lt;n&gt;</code>
* <code>/jackpot enter amount:&lt;n&gt;</code>
* <code>/jackpot status</code>
* <code>/treasury</code>

== Jackpot Rules ==
* Weighted by contribution
* Single-user effective contribution cap applies
* Jackpot rounds resolve on cooldown
* Larger jackpot payouts can trigger Treasury tax

== Tax Flow ==
Jackpot tax defaults:
* Threshold: 2000
* Tax rate: 8%

Collected tax goes into Treasury and helps fund live event payouts.

== Safety Rules ==
* No real-money mechanics
* No forced wallet deletion
* No trading-based exploit loops in launch version

